  "title": "Chewy Chocolate-Toffee-Oatmeal Cookies with Cranberries Recipe",
  "description": "This easy, chewy chocolate-toffee-oatmeal cookies with cranberries recipe has a bit of everything — bittersweet chocolate, toffee, oats, and cranberries.",
